## explore-test-action-complete.soar -- thor-soar: 1 elaboration, 1 proposal, 1 application.

## Elaborate explore untested-action -> sets untested-action.
sp {explore*untested-action
    :default
   (state <s> ^name thor-soar
              ^explore-structure <es>)
   (<es> ^actions.action.action-handle <action-handle>
         ^current-class <class>)
   (<class> -^tested-action.action.action-handle <action-handle>)
-->
   (<class> ^untested-action true)
}

## Propose explore-test-action-complete.
sp {explore*propose*class-test-action-complete
    :default
   (state <s> ^name thor-soar
              ^explore-structure.current-class <class>)
   (<class> -^untested-action true
               -^tested-action.need-undo-action true)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <op> + =)
   (<op> ^name explore-test-action-complete
         ^explore-operator true)
}

## Apply explore-test-action-complete -> sets complete, current-class.
sp {apply*explore-test-action-complete
    :default
   (state <s> ^operator <op>
              ^explore-structure <es>)
   (<es> ^current-class <class>)
   (<op> ^name explore-test-action-complete)
-->
   (<class> ^complete true
                         false -)
   (<es> ^current-class <class> -)
}
